---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Terminal from "../components/Terminal.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kineti — ship proof"
  description="Ship proof and spend cap for any coding agent. Claude, Cursor, Grok, Gemini, Llama, and fx write the code. Kineti binds tests to file hashes, caps the bill, and fails merge if the proof is stale."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-14 pb-10 sm:px-6 sm:pt-20">
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">
        Ship proof and spend cap for any coding agent.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-base">
        Claude, Cursor, Grok, Gemini, Llama, and fx write the code. Kineti binds tests
        to file hashes, caps the bill, and fails merge if the proof is stale.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-copy-install
          class="rounded-none border border-accent bg-surface-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-surface"
        >
          <span data-copy-label>Copy install</span>
        </button>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/therawlogs/kineti"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-none border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm text-fg transition-colors hover:border-accent"
          >Source</a
        >
        <a
          href="/docs/getting-started"
          class="rounded-none border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm text-fg transition-colors hover:border-accent"
          >Docs</a
        >
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl">
        <Terminal />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three steps -->
  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xs tracking-wide text-muted">Three steps</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="border border-line bg-surface p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-wide text-accent">01</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-fg">kineti init</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Scaffold <code class="text-accent">.kineti/</code> + <code class="text-accent">kineti.toml</code>. Edit caps in the file.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-line bg-surface p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-wide text-accent">02</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-fg">kineti evidence --cmd "your test"</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">After the agent edits, bind test result to file hashes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-line bg-surface p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-wide text-accent">03</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-fg">kineti ship-check</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">In CI: red if files moved since the proof. Also <code class="text-accent">kineti verify --all</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Full path: <code class="text-accent">init → evidence → ship-check → receipt → verify</code>.
        See <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="text-accent hover:underline">Getting started</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ONE TABLE -->
  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xs tracking-wide text-muted">What it enforces</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto border border-line">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] border-collapse text-left text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-line bg-surface-2 text-xs tracking-wide text-muted">
              <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-normal">If this happens</th>
              <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-normal">Kineti</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-line transition-colors hover:bg-surface-2">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted">Tests ran on old files</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-danger">Ship refused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-line transition-colors hover:bg-surface-2">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted">Spend over cap</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-danger">Run stops until a human reset file</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="transition-colors hover:bg-surface-2">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted">Journal byte flipped</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-danger"><code class="text-accent">verify</code> fails</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
